{"unit_id":"loyalchiiina__dsh-model-fold#card-zh","repo":"loyalchiiina/dsh-model-fold","commit":"5ae2ed855f753d10685e3143963a7f814425b786","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-fold 是一个面向 DSH Web 与桌面客户端的模型菜单界面插件，会按模型来源分组展示可选模型，并在来源旁创建独立的模型面板。用户可以通过悬停或点击查看来源中的模型，也能切换行内列表、悬浮和侧面板模式；当前来源与模型会醒目标识，面板外观跟随宿主主题。它适合配置了多个模型来源、希望更快浏览和切换模型的 DSH 用户。插件不需要 API 密钥或额外账号，使用本地 DOM 界面增强，并在浏览器本地记住显示偏好。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:11-15","lib/client.js:624-700","lib/client.js:1125-1300","package.json:27-31"]}
{"unit_id":"loyalchiiina__dsh-model-fold#card-en","repo":"loyalchiiina/dsh-model-fold","commit":"5ae2ed855f753d10685e3143963a7f814425b786","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-fold groups the DSH model picker by provider and opens each source's models in a side panel. Users can browse by hovering or clicking, or choose inline, hover, and panel modes. It highlights the active model, follows the host theme, needs no API key, and stores preferences locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:11-15","lib/client.js:624-700","lib/client.js:1125-1300","package.json:27-31"]}
